<title>HONG KONG: HK bourse forming group to examine second board.</title>
<headline>HK bourse forming group to examine second board.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Stock Exchange of Hong Kong said on Thursday it was forming a working group to examine the creation of a second board.</p>
<p>&quot;We are still trying to form the group. The group will look at capital raising arrangements for growth companies,&quot; a spokesman said.</p>
<p>There have been calls in Hong Kong for the creation of a second board on the exchange to encourage the listing of smaller companies and high-technology firms.</p>
<p>&quot;The group will examine what the market needs,&quot; the exchange spokesman said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6345.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
